table usages
	lineageTag: 62d12905-7bf9-4346-b024-b583bb305eb3

	measure 'YTD Consumption' = ```
			
			        CALCULATE(          
			            SUM(usages[quantity]),          
			            FILTER(          
			                ALLSELECTED(usages[usage_date]), 
			                usages[usage_date] <= MAX(usages[usage_date]) 
			        )
			)
			```
		lineageTag: 3b817d49-3b47-4d74-9213-8213159e820a

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

